        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Nice layout & location. We rented both sides and the open door between the two made for easy access...The beach was amazing! Very well keep and manicured. The walk to the beach was just a couple of minutes, thru the alley, down the boardwalk.The entire 30A area is clean, safe, and has a very walkable path. Shared with bikers so be aware.The communication with Beach Habitats was second to none!",
